      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹3.34 (down from ₹4.12 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹83.5m (down 14% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹16.7m (down 19% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 20% (down from 21% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 13% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 15% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
